cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SIGNET — Secure Intelligent Governed Network for Exchange and Trade
message: >-
  If you use the SIGNET standard, please cite it using the metadata in
  this file.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  SIGNET is the open specification for procurement networks in which human
  and synthetic agents operate under shared governance, decentralised
  identity, and cryptographic trust. This repository holds the normative
  artifacts: the Canonical Data Model as JSON Schema, the JSON-LD context,
  controlled codelists, worked examples, and conformance materials.
authors:
  - name: Concert Foundation
    website: https://concert.foundation
keywords:
  - procurement
  - open-standard
  - data-model
  - json-schema
  - json-ld
  - synthetic-agents
  - EN 16931
  - Peppol BIS Billing
  - OCDS
license: CC0-1.0
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-06-22"
url: https://concert.foundation/standard
repository-code: https://github.com/concerthq/signet-standard
